  "comment": "",
  "content": "== Backoff policy ==\n\nBase 30 s, factor 2, max 5 attempts, jitter ±10 %. Transient codes: HTTP 503, ##TEMP_UNAVAILABLE##. After the final attempt the payout is moved to the manual review queue (see PAY-231).\n\n== Manual review queue ==\n\n//SLA: to be defined.//\n",
